{title: Wo Jab Yaad Aaye}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Lata Mangeshkar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F] [C] [F],        wo jab yaad aaye, bahot yaad aaye
[F] [G] [F],        gam-e-zindagi ke, andhere men hum hain
[F] [C] [F],        chiraag-e-mohabbat jalaaye, bujhaaye
[F] [C] [G] [F],        aahate jaag uthhi, raasate hans diye
[F] [C] [G] [F],        thaamakar dil uthe, hum kisi ke liye
[F] [G] [F],        kai baar aisa bhi dhokha hua hain
[F] [C] [F],        chale aa rahe hai, wo nazare jhukaye
wo jab yaad aaye,        [F] [C] [G] [F]
dil sulagane laga, ashk bahane lage,        [F] [C] [G] [F]
jaane kya kya hume, log kahane lage,        [F] [G] [F]
magar rote rote hansi aa gai hain,        [F] [C] [F]
khayaalon men aa ke, wo jab muskuraye,        wo jab yaad aaye
[F] [C] [G] [F],        wo juda kya huye, zindagi kho gai
[F] [C] [G] [F],        shamma jalati rahi, roshani kho gai
[F] [G] [F],        bahoot koshishen ki, magar dil na bahala
[F] [C] [F],        kai saaz chhede, kai geet gae
wo jab yaad aaye
